# KI-003: Different catalyst masses can have the same nominal surface area
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
add v1 MnO2 0.001g
grind v1 MnO2 10um
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H2O2 0.001mol
add v2 MnO2 0.01g
grind v2 MnO2 100um
wait 10s
inspect
wait 20s
inspect
